@DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5149

### Health Check
GET {{DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List all documents
GET {{DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a single document
POST {{DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a test document.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Get a specific document (replace {documentId} with actual blob name)
GET {{DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}
Accept: application/octet-stream

###

### Delete a specific document (replace {documentId} with actual blob name)
DELETE {{DocumentUploaderAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{documentId}
Accept: application/json

###
